    "answer": {
      "short": "$125$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2^{a-b}&=2^3\\\\a-b&=3\\\\\\frac{5^a}{5^b}&=5^{a-b}\\\\\\frac{5^a}{5^b}&=5^3\\\\\\frac{5^a}{5^b}&=125\\end{align*}$$",
